Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.14,0:00:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guitar solo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.74,0:01:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I picked up my first gun at\Nthe age of seven and I shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember how strangely easy\Nit was to pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because that one shot was all it took to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finally silence that\Nsickening piece of garbage
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who had the nerve to\Ncall himself my guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, I was free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, tomorrow things would be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I wanted to believe,\Nit only went from bad to worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A vicious cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life is like an incessant\Nseries of problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All seem difficult, with\Nbrutal choices and a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The single worst thing we\Ncan do is to make no choice
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while we're waiting for\Nthe answer to come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must make the best\Ndecision in a split second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.42,0:02:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are nothing like God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only are our powers limited,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we sometimes are driven to\Nbecome the devil himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want other kids to grow up\Nlike me, so I started my own orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was gratifying work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was actually doing something\Nfor the good of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my place of peace and happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet sometimes, I still think to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no place worse than this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's horrible here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do.\NI don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand you, Knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you enjoy this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing's filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.58,0:04:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't gonna shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, please don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are extenuating\Ncircumstances you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still need some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not healthy to hesitate,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because every time you do you wear\Ndown a little more of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I told you that before haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently you've lost some weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why Nicholas?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.66,0:05:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been traveling\Nwith a real troublemaker
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not wise to drown\Nin each other's pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to kill this man now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Knives specifically told\Nme to bring him back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The order was not to destroy him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that order has been retracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry It will be\Npaid as promised follow
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through with your mission\Nand I guarantee the lives
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of your precious December\Norphan children upon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the holy name of the chapel\Nof the gung-ho guns and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As of now you too my friend\Nare also a gung-ho gun
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.70,0:06:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deal with the situation as instructed,\Nand you will inherit my title.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way he looked at me, it was as\Nthough he was the one who killed the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.20,0:07:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'll take the blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit me if you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, maybe at least I can... Mr. Priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping I'd find you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you might be hungry, so\NMeryl and I made you sandwiches,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'd be very happy if you'd eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, and you take\Nyour coffee black, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you said anything\Nanything about the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:07:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:07:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I just don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so confused
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because what you said\Nwas right and what mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash said was true, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I I don't like it when people have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even in such an impossible situation,\Nhe keeps saying that nobody had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash has always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know because I've watched\Nhim for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's lived by that rule his whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very important to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thou shalt not kill, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of\Nchurch man are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:09:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lived my life very differently from\Nhim, and I guess I have to accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to guide him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.28,0:09:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was ordered to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my job to be there for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the mission, the obligation,\Nit doesn't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I honestly wanted to save him,\Neven if it meant killing a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually wanted to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.86,0:09:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to choose one or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did I go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always chosen the\Nright path, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.22,0:09:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.54,0:09:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please eat the sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you please eat them with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie's so late getting back to her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I say to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you leaving without saying goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have hit you the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.16,0:10:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe there was a way out of that problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe what we should have done\Nwould have been something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.35,0:11:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our lives are too different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash you and I were\Ndestined to come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's part of who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.52,0:11:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long ago we started a\Nquick draw tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to settle it\Nat last right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why at this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I tell you, will\Nyou agree to die? Draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.28,0:11:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in return, will you\Ndo something for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When this is all over and I'm dead,\Nyou won't ever shoot anyone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When this is over and I'm dead,\Nyou don't ever shoot anyone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you actually expect me to become\Na living target like you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.24,0:12:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, so how do you plan to\Nget out of this predicament, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then answer me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're obviously going after Knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you intend to\Ndo once you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Many years ago, he stole someone\Nwho was very important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's how you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you choose to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:13:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an expert at\Npissing me off. Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wolfwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be Kane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably sniping from\Nthe outskirts of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.18,0:13:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something\Nnow, he will hit his target.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's not alone. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go after Kane?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have any\Nproblem finding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other one's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I only know\Nyou as the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you can at least\Ntell me your real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna tell you just so you\Ncan go out and get killed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't be stupid. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between you and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to get back to business, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.52,0:14:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Walpole!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.64,0:14:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear gunfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm staying here, Merrill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told me to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.58,0:14:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made me promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm not moving until he comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.48,0:15:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He let me in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only clues I had were\Nthe lag time between rifle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reports and my rough calculations\Nof the angles on impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a hard time finding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, gee, now, since your gun's gone\Nto pieces, why don't you head on home?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too hot out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.34,0:15:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, I'm glad you're seeing it my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.55,0:15:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where will he attack from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.42,0:16:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now what's the best choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gonna be it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a huge disappointment to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you'd so easily waste\Nthe ten years of training I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.90,0:17:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it wasn't wasted at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've used everything you've taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just decided to do things\Na little differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.60,0:17:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May you go with God's protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.98,0:17:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, and thanks for the app.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong I failed I failed to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.52,0:18:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,save someone again man is born a mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.38,0:18:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being and we all make mistakes it's\Npart of the game just be more careful
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the next time it's hard for me to\Naccept making mistakes like this then
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can choose to suffer that's also\Na part of the experience of mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Knives is in Dimitri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never told you anything about Knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind\Nme barging in like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In spite of the profession I've chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never actually made\Na confession before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's these times we live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.36,0:19:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did what it took to protect\Nthe children at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I always justified my actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took many people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that time, believing\Nthere was no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sins are so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too heavy to ever atone for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, somehow I feel happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At peace with myself today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you stop to think about it, there\Nare plenty of ways to save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.12,0:20:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I ever listen to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I see that\Nbefore it was too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That tastes good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know cigarettes are\Nbad for the baby, darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.28,0:20:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I am reincarnated, I'd like to\Nlive somewhere where life is easier!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere with nothing but peaceful days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.66,0:20:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere with no stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eden?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Eden?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.66,0:20:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could live happily\Nwith him, and the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still so much left to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.80,0:21:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was everything I did in my life a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would I be wrong now to\Nask for your forgiveness?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.14,0:21:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not want to die this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.28,0:22:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.76,0:22:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Underneath the blue sky,\Nthe wind is in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:23:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day of the day, the\Nlight is in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.58,0:23:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.49,0:23:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.88,0:23:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.74,0:23:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.80,0:23:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have a right hand and a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.38,0:23:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have a right hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.84,0:24:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repeated tragedies, repeated pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.96,0:24:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the wishes of a man are so\Nstrong and yet so frail and weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.10,0:24:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To live,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to stay alive, who would have known that\Nsurvival was this hard, this painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.54,0:24:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.04,0:24:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must make the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.06,0:24:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the moment that intertwines life and\Ndeath, can I choose to remain a human?

